    "Follows the system language (Chinese / English). Set a language for picsee in System Settings → General → Language & Region.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Follows the system language (Chinese / English). Set a language for picsee in System Settings → General → Language & Region."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "跟随系统语言（中文 / English）。可在“系统设置 → 通用 → 语言与地区”为 picsee 单独设置。"}}}},
