    "Hits and misses count memory lookups, made only by images the disk cache can’t hold: larger than 1024 px (such as Actual Pixels), opened as a single file without a folder grant, or not prepared by the disk cache. Everything else counts under Thumbnail Disk Cache; pinned pixels still show in Entries and Size.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hits and misses count memory lookups, made only by images the disk cache can’t hold: larger than 1024 px (such as Actual Pixels), opened as a single file without a folder grant, or not prepared by the disk cache. Everything else counts under Thumbnail Disk Cache; pinned pixels still show in Entries and Size."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命中与未命中只统计内存查找，仅磁盘缓存无法保存的图片会做这次查找：超过 1024 像素（如实际像素）、作为单个文件打开而没有文件夹授权，或磁盘缓存未能准备的图片。其余都计入“磁盘缩略图缓存”；钉住的像素仍计入条目和大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counts grid thumbnails and viewer images up to 1024 px from folders you granted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Counts grid thumbnails and viewer images up to 1024 px from folders you granted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "统计已授权文件夹中的网格缩略图，以及不超过 1024 像素的查看器图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
